<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάττω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔναξα</span> (v. infr.): pf.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νένασμαι</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέναγμαι</span> (v. infr.):—<i>press, squeeze
				close, stamp down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖαν ἔναξε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.122
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ παῖδες ἔναττον εἰς τὰς
				σπυρίδας</span> Hippoloch. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.130b
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be piled up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κόπρος ἡ νεναγμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat. Puer.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δὲ [τῇ στιβάδι] νένασται . .
					δέρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					9.9
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῖναι σισυρῶν νεναγμέναι
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νενασμ</span>- codd.) <i>piled
				up</i> with . . , <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				840
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stuff quite full</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάττω τὸν θύλακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epict.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσα οἰκία ὁπλιτῶν νένακτο</span>
			<i>was crammed with</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.17.6
			</span></i>.</div>
